type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰属性</font></span></span>]范围伤害；攻击前，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×反应技</font></span></span>]，持续2回合，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]（持续2回合），<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">锋芒</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5十字 1圈.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/33/9rkbhpgh304kmloi3u5cy67f523cbur.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_1%E5%9C%88.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/33/9rkbhpgh304kmloi3u5cy67f523cbur.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_1%E5%9C%88.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/33/9rkbhpgh304kmloi3u5cy67f523cbur.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_1%E5%9C%88.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"752\" data-file-height=\"752\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;